/-!
# A084346

Triangle read by rows in which row n gives decomposition of Fib(n)*Fib(n+1) into non-adjacent Fibonacci numbers (given by their indices).

The 83 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A084346

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [2, 3, 5, 2, 7, 3, 9, 5, 2, 11,
    7, 3, 13, 9, 5, 2, 15, 11, 7, 3,
    17, 13, 9, 5, 2, 19, 15, 11, 7, 3,
